Orpheus
=======

Orpheus is a modified version of JellyBox ("JellyBoxPlayer"), a music player
for Jellyfin, Emby and Navidrome.

  Original work:  JellyBox, https://github.com/avdept/JellyBoxPlayer
                  Copyright (C) ProdigyTech Inc. / Alex Sinelnikov and
                  contributors
  This fork:      https://github.com/imprudent-coding/Orpheus

